---
import { site, org } from '../site';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const [postalCode, ...addressParts] = site.address.split(' ');
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-columns">
    <div class="footer-about">
      <div class="footer-heading-slot">
        <img class="footer-logo" src={site.logo} alt={site.name} width="220" height="70" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3>{site.tagline}</h3>
      <p>這次我們來到地球，展開 ”身而為人” 的旅程，體驗各式各樣的情緒、感受、欲望，人與人之間的相處互動，人與萬物&amp;宇宙的關係。而最終要落地回到「好好做人，好好生活」。</p>
      <p>關係花園的課程，以「關係」為核心，依循著生命的路徑，整合研發出一系列「意識覺醒之旅」課程，讓生命從「面對自己、遇見自己、與自己合一」，最後憶起真正的我是誰！提升生活與生命的品質，「關係和諧有愛、生命豐富完整、心靈圓滿自由」。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-contact">
      <div class="footer-heading-slot"><h3>{site.company}</h3></div>
      <ul class="contact">
        <li>{postalCode}<br />{addressParts.join(' ')}</li>
        <li>Mail：<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
        <li>LINE：<a href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/@rsg.garden">{site.line}</a></li>
        <li>電話：<a href={`tel:${site.phone.replace(/-/g, '')}`}>{site.phone}</a></li>
        <li>傳真：{site.fax}</li>
      </ul>
      <nav class="footer-social" aria-label="關係花園社群與聯絡方式">
        <a class="facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/rsg.garden" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook（另開視窗）" title="Facebook">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M14 22v-9h3l.5-3H14V8c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5H18V3.2c-.4-.1-1.8-.2-3.4-.2C11.3 3 9 5 9 8.4V10H6v3h3v9z" /></svg>
        </a>
        <a class="instagram" href="https://www.instagram.com/relationship.garden/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram（另開視窗）" title="Instagram">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" /><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" /></svg>
        </a>
        <a class="podcast" href="https://open.firstory.me/user/ckqxfeidqr0wb09396hwq94d2/platforms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Podcast 關係聊天室（另開視窗）" title="Podcast 關係聊天室"><img src="/media/2022/11/podcast_icon.png" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy" /></a>
        <a class="youtube" href="https://www.youtube.com/user/rsg2005" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube（另開視窗）" title="YouTube">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="4" fill="currentColor" /><path d="m10 9 6 3-6 3z" fill="#cd201f" /></svg>
        </a>
        <a class="mail" href={`mailto:${site.email}`} aria-label="電子郵件" title="電子郵件">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="5" width="19" height="14" rx="1" /><path d="m3 6 9 7 9-7" /></svg>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-sitemap">
      <div class="footer-heading-slot"><h3>網站地圖</h3></div>
      <nav aria-label="頁尾網站地圖"><ul>
        {site.footerLinks.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a></li>)}
      </ul></nav>
      <form class="footer-search" action="/search" method="get" role="search" aria-label="頁尾站內搜尋">
        <label class="visually-hidden" for="footer-search-query">搜尋本站</label>
        <input id="footer-search-query" name="q" type="search" placeholder="搜尋…" required />
        <button type="submit" aria-label="搜尋"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6" /><path d="m15 15 5 5" /></svg></button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-copyright"><div class="container">© Copyright {org.foundingDate} - {year} | Relationship Garden Theme by <a href="/">Relationship Garden</a> | All Rights Reserved | Powered by <a href="https://www.vae.marketing/">梵亞行銷</a></div></div>
</footer>
